    "Attack Attribute": "None",
    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 53, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 A unicorn aimlessly drifting after losing its home long ago. It has wandered since the Era of Myths ended with Einhasad's rage against the Lesser Giants. The leader of the unicorns lost its herd while roaming the world. Although it is still desperately looking for its fellow unicorns, hundreds of years have passed since it parted ways from them. Wandering alone, it still has not adapted itself to the human world. Spirits Lv. 7 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Spirits. P. Def. +5% Evasion +5 Resistance to Derangement +20% Resistance to Sleep +20% M. Def. -5% Accuracy -5 Light Armor Type Lv. 3 Weak P. Def. and strong Evasion. Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
